    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/09/2",
    "published": "2026-09-09T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"What? MacDougal is being promoted over me? Well, that does it! I won't take no orders from no stinkin' sodbuster!\""
